# ─── LILY Personal Docs — Never Push These ───────────────────────────────────
# Local-only working area: agentic MDs, exact roadmaps, architecture decisions.
# Loose root-level docs from the early plan are still ignored for safety.
.docs/
# .tmp/ is the scratch area: recon dumps (vault paths, binary hashes), sweep stderr,
# per-run AFM logs. Ignored for the same reason .docs/ is -- it describes this person's
# vault, and a `git add -A` after a long experiment day must not notice.
.tmp/
project_context.md
tech_stack.md
Call-To-Action-Plan.md

# ─── Vault Identity Files — Your Soul, Stay Local ────────────────────────────
.vault/agent-profile/my_profile.md
.vault/agent-profile/my_rules.md
.vault/agent-profile/my_feedback.md

# ─── Environment & Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .envs/ = local env files + templates. Named `.envs` (not `.env`) so the root
#          `.env` *file* convention stays available for dotenv loaders.
# .keys/ = API keys, tokens, credentials. chmod 700. Never pushed, never logged.
# Root .env / .env.* stay ignored as well, for any tool that hard-codes that path.
.envs/
.keys/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Belt & Braces: secret material wherever it appears ──────────────────────
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.kdbx
.netrc
credentials.json
service-account*.json
*_token
*_key
*_api_key*
*_secret*
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets.yaml
secrets.toml

# ─── LILY Brain — Local Vector DB & Model Adapters ───────────────────────────
.lily_brain/
*.lily_index/
my_lora_adapter/

# ─── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# ─── Obsidian ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.trash/

# ─── Audio / Voice Data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.m4a
voice-notes/

# ─── Logs & Autoresearch Reports ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
autoresearch_logs/
autoresearch/experiments/

# The experiment loop writes its history into the project dir. Those artefacts quote note
# titles and retrieved snippets from the vault, so in a repo that gets pushed they are a
# vault leak by another name. Ignored unconditionally.
results.tsv
best_config.json
autoresearch/
autoresearch/reviews/
.lily-research/
*.chunks.json
evals/*.jsonl
!evals/eval-set.example.jsonl

# ─── OS Noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── n8n ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.n8n/
n8n_workflows/*.json

# ─── IDE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
